Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Hey, Pepsi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:04.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Quick shipping question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A cap fits in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}my mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Where the fuck are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:08.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}you putting the fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:11.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}jet? The best part?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A guy actually mailed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}you a {\c&H006DDCFF&}check{\r} for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}In the ad, a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}kid flies a military
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}jet to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Seven {\c&H006DDCFF&}million{\r} points, right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}there on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Everybody laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}John Leonard gets his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}calculator. Comedy is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.68,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}folks. Accounting has entered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Hell of a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Friday you're selling fizzy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}water. Monday you're running
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a fucking aircraft dealership.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The rules let you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:41.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}buy extra points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Ten cents each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Why the hell would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}you drink that much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}soda? Your kidneys would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}quit long before your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}driveway became a fucking airfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Watch his order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Seven {\c&H006DDCFF&}million{\r} points needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He already has fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:00:59.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Buy the rest at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}ten cents each.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Then ten bucks for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}shipping! Jesus Christ, I've
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:05.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}paid more to ship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}socks. Total: seven hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:08.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}thousand eight dollars and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}fifty cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}That's one hell of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a shopping cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Pepsi returned the {\c&H006DDCFF&}check{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}John sued and lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The judge thought the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}joke was obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}But consider this absolute
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}shitshow. It took a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}federal court to explain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.06,0:01:25.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the punchline of a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}soda commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Next time, maybe just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}wink at the fucking camera?
